WEBVTT

00:09.655 --> 00:10.965
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:11.034 --> 00:12.758
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN.
所有人：是，是，队长。

00:12.827 --> 00:14.241
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.310 --> 00:16.137
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN.
所有人：是，是，队长。

00:16.206 --> 00:19.344
- ♪ OHH... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:19.413 --> 00:21.310
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.379 --> 00:23.586
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
所有：海绵宝宝。

00:23.655 --> 00:25.379
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.448 --> 00:27.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
所有：海绵宝宝。

00:27.448 --> 00:29.379
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.448 --> 00:31.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
所有：海绵宝宝。

00:31.448 --> 00:33.482
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.551 --> 00:35.275
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝。
- 准备好？

00:35.344 --> 00:37.310
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
所有：海绵宝宝。

00:37.379 --> 00:39.241
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝。

00:39.310 --> 00:41.172
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝。

00:41.241 --> 00:42.413
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.482 --> 00:44.724
SQUAREPANTS.
方裤。

00:44.793 --> 00:47.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:47.310 --> 00:49.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.517 --> 00:50.655
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.586 --> 00:56.517
[jolly instrumental music]
[欢快的器乐]

00:56.586 --> 01:04.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:05.379 --> 01:09.241
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:09.310 --> 01:12.241
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

01:12.310 --> 01:13.379
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

01:13.448 --> 01:15.965
[exhales]
[呼气]

01:16.034 --> 01:17.896
GOOD MORNING, DAY.
早上好，白天。

01:17.965 --> 01:19.517
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:19.586 --> 01:20.482
crack!
裂缝！

01:20.551 --> 01:21.862
OW!
噢！

01:21.931 --> 01:24.000
I STUBBED MY TOE.
我碰伤了脚趾。

01:24.068 --> 01:26.758
[sobs]
[抽泣]

01:30.034 --> 01:31.724
I STUBBED MY TOE!
我碰伤了脚趾！

01:31.793 --> 01:33.103
[cries]
[哭声]

01:38.655 --> 01:39.965
rip!
撕裂！

01:40.034 --> 01:43.241
OH, THAT WAS MY FAVORITE SHIRT.
哦，那是我最喜欢的衬衫。

01:43.310 --> 01:46.310
[sobs]
[抽泣]

01:46.379 --> 01:48.931
- AND THAT WAS AJA
BY EELY DAN.
- 那是阿贾
作者：伊利·丹。

01:49.000 --> 01:53.413
NEXT UP IS LIONEL FISHY
WITH HIS HIT, SAD SONG.
下一个是莱昂内尔·菲什
伴随着他的热门歌曲，悲伤的歌曲。

01:53.482 --> 01:56.620
[somber string music]
[忧郁的弦乐]

01:56.689 --> 01:58.896
- [cries]
- [哭声]

01:58.965 --> 02:02.206
A SO SAD SONG!
一首悲伤的歌！

02:02.275 --> 02:05.241
- THAT SPONGEBOB
IS SUCH A CRYBABY.
- 那个海绵宝宝
真是个爱哭鬼。

02:05.310 --> 02:06.620
LUCKY ME.
幸运的是我。

02:06.689 --> 02:09.586
I GET TO WORK WITH HIM ALL DAY.
我整天和他一起工作。

02:09.655 --> 02:12.655
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

02:14.965 --> 02:16.241
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA ♪
♪ 拉-拉-拉-拉 ♪

02:16.310 --> 02:17.758
♪ LA-LA-BOP-BOP-BA-DA ♪
♪ 拉-拉-波普-波普-巴-达 ♪

02:17.827 --> 02:19.517
YOW!
- SPONGEBOB, GUESS WHAT.
哟！
- 海绵宝宝，你猜怎么着。

02:19.586 --> 02:21.620
YEAH, I'LL COME BACK LATER.
是的，我稍后回来。

02:25.344 --> 02:27.586
- HE WAS A GOOD LITTLE
KRABBY PATTY.
- 他是个好孩子
蟹肉饼。

02:27.655 --> 02:28.827
[sniffles]
[抽鼻子]

02:28.896 --> 02:30.137
I DIDN'T KNOW HIM WELL,
我不太了解他，

02:30.206 --> 02:31.413
BUT IN THE FEW SHORT SECONDS
但在短短的几秒钟内

02:31.482 --> 02:33.724
BETWEEN GRILL AND FLOOR...
烤架和地板之间...

02:33.793 --> 02:36.000
I CAME TO LOVE HIM.
我开始爱他了。

02:36.068 --> 02:39.965
[cries]
[哭声]

02:40.034 --> 02:42.862
IT JUST ISN'T FAIR!
这不公平！

02:42.931 --> 02:45.689
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

02:48.344 --> 02:51.586
- SPONGEBOB,
WILL YOU STOP CRYING?
- 海绵宝宝，
你会停止哭泣吗？

02:51.655 --> 02:53.620
- BUT THE KRABBY PATTY FELL ON
THE FLOOR AND THEN HE--
- 但是蟹肉饼掉下来了
地板，然后他——

02:53.689 --> 02:55.379
- KRABBY PATTY NOTHING.
- 蟹黄派 没什么。

02:55.448 --> 02:56.620
- BUT--
- 但 -

02:56.689 --> 02:58.896
- KRABBY PATTY NOTHING!
- 蟹蟹派蒂 什么也没有！

02:58.965 --> 03:01.137
[breathes heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

03:01.206 --> 03:03.517
WHAT NOW?
现在怎么办？

03:03.586 --> 03:05.931
- YOU YELLED AT ME.
- 你对我大喊大叫。

03:06.000 --> 03:08.000
YOU YELLED AT ME!
你对我大喊大叫！

03:08.068 --> 03:10.310
[sobs]
[抽泣]

03:10.379 --> 03:11.586
- ALL RIGHT, LOOK.
- 好吧，看。

03:11.655 --> 03:12.896
SO FAR TODAY,
今天到目前为止，

03:12.965 --> 03:14.965
AND IT'S NOT EVEN 2:00 YET,
现在还不到 2:00，

03:15.034 --> 03:18.586
YOU HAVE CRIED
43 TIMES.
你哭了
43 次。

03:18.655 --> 03:20.655
- AND YOU WROTE THAT NUMBER
ON A CHALKBOARD?
- 你写下了这个数字
在黑板上？

03:20.724 --> 03:21.655
- YES!
- 是的！

03:21.724 --> 03:23.758
- WHY?
- 为什么？

03:23.827 --> 03:25.758
- I HAVE NO IDEA.
- 我不知道。

03:25.827 --> 03:28.344
- OH, SQUIDWARD,
THERE'S NO WAY I CRY THAT MUCH.
-哦，章鱼哥，
我不可能哭得那么厉害。

03:28.413 --> 03:30.310
THERE'S NOT THAT MANY TEARS
IN MY BRAIN.
没有那么多眼泪
在我的脑子里。

03:30.379 --> 03:32.172
- AU CONTRAIRE.
- 相反。

03:32.241 --> 03:33.862
- WHAT'S THIS?
- 这是什么？

03:33.931 --> 03:35.034
- IT'S A QUICK MONTAGE
OF FLASHBACKS
- 这是一个快速蒙太奇
闪回

03:35.103 --> 03:36.379
I'VE EDITED TOGETHER
我一起编辑过

03:36.448 --> 03:37.724
THAT SHOWS THE HUNDREDS OF TEARS
这显示了数百滴眼泪

03:37.793 --> 03:39.793
YOU HAVE CRIED OVER THE YEARS.
这些年来你一直在哭泣。

03:39.862 --> 03:42.241
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

03:47.724 --> 03:49.758
[sniffling]
[抽鼻子]

03:52.379 --> 03:56.551
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

03:56.620 --> 03:58.586
STOP.
IT BURNS.
停止。
它燃烧了。

03:58.655 --> 04:00.724
[French narrator]
THOUSANDS OF TEARS LATER...
[法语旁白]
事后泪流满面……

04:00.793 --> 04:03.206
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

04:03.275 --> 04:04.448
WOW.
哇。

04:04.517 --> 04:05.758
GUESS I DO CRY A LOT.
我想我确实哭了很多。

04:05.827 --> 04:08.206
I PROMISE I WON'T CRY ANYMORE.
我保证我不会再哭了。

04:08.275 --> 04:10.241
- OH, NONSENSE.
- 哦，废话。

04:10.310 --> 04:14.000
I BET YOU CAN'T GO THE REST
OF THE DAY WITHOUT CRYING.
我打赌你不能去剩下的
一天中没有哭泣。

04:14.068 --> 04:15.793
- EXCUSE ME A MINUTE.
- 请原谅我一下。

04:19.275 --> 04:20.758
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

04:20.827 --> 04:22.482
- [slowly]
STAR RESIDENCE.
- [慢慢地]
星级住宅。

04:22.551 --> 04:24.034
PATRICK SPEAKING.
帕特里克讲话。

04:24.103 --> 04:25.103
- HEY, PATRICK.
- 嘿，帕特里克。

04:25.172 --> 04:26.241
- HEY, BUDDY!
- 嘿，伙计！

04:26.310 --> 04:27.931
IS IT 7:30 ALREADY?
已经 7:30 了吗？

04:28.000 --> 04:29.137
- NO, I'M STILL AT WORK.
- 不，我还在工作。

04:29.206 --> 04:31.137
- HOW CAN I HELP YOU?
- 我怎么帮你？

04:31.206 --> 04:33.000
- DO YOU THINK THAT I COULD GO
THE REST OF THE DAY
- 你认为我可以去吗
今天剩下的时间

04:33.068 --> 04:34.758
WITHOUT CRYING?
不哭？

04:34.827 --> 04:36.413
- WELL, OF COURSE YOU CAN.
- 嗯，当然可以。

04:36.482 --> 04:38.517
- OKAY, GREAT.
THANKS, PATRICK.
- 好的，太好了。
谢谢，帕特里克。

04:38.586 --> 04:40.413
- SURE.
- 当然。

04:40.482 --> 04:42.448
DID YOU REMEMBER TO PUT
THAT PACKAGE OUTSIDE
你记得放吗
外面那个包裹

04:42.517 --> 04:44.344
WHERE I TOLD YOU?
我在哪里告诉过你的？

04:44.413 --> 04:46.034
- YEAH, BUT I LEFT IT
IN A DIFFERENT SPOT.
- 是的，但我把它留下了
在不同的地方。

04:46.103 --> 04:48.000
JUST ASK GARY.
HE KNOWS WHERE IT IS.
问问加里就知道了。
他知道它在哪里。

04:48.068 --> 04:51.379
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

04:51.448 --> 04:53.620
HEY, GOOD ONE, BUDDY.
嘿，好人，伙计。

04:53.689 --> 04:55.379
YOU ALMOST HAD ME THERE.
你差点就让我在那儿了。

04:55.448 --> 04:56.655
- [laughs] OKAY.
- [笑] 好吧。

04:56.724 --> 04:58.310
- YEAH, TALK TO YOU LATER.
- 是的，稍后再谈。

04:58.379 --> 05:00.586
- ALL RIGHT, SEE YOU.
- 好的，再见。

05:00.655 --> 05:02.103
OKAY, IT'S A BET.
好吧，这是一个赌注。

05:02.172 --> 05:03.586
- FINE.
- 美好的。

05:03.655 --> 05:05.241
IF YOU CRY ONE TEAR
BEFORE MIDNIGHT,
如果你哭一滴眼泪
午夜之前，

05:05.310 --> 05:08.000
YOU HAVE TO WASH MY BIKE,
你必须洗我的自行车，

05:08.068 --> 05:09.724
CLEAN OUT MY RAIN GUTTERS,
清理我的雨水槽，

05:09.793 --> 05:11.758
AND DO ALL MY YARD WORK
FOR A YEAR.
做我所有的院子工作
一年。

05:11.827 --> 05:13.448
- SOUNDS FAIR TO ME.
- 对我来说听起来很公平。

05:13.517 --> 05:15.379
AND IF I MAKE IT TO MIDNIGHT
WITHOUT CRYING,
如果我能熬到午夜
不哭，

05:15.448 --> 05:17.275
YOU'LL COME TO A SLUMBER PARTY
AT MY PLACE,
你会参加一场睡衣派对
在我的地方，

05:17.344 --> 05:19.413
JUST YOU AND ME.
只有你和我。

05:19.482 --> 05:20.655
- [gags]
- [笑声]

05:20.724 --> 05:21.862
- OOH, WHAT'S A MATTER?
- 哦，出什么事了？

05:21.931 --> 05:23.379
- UM, NOTHING.
- 嗯，没什么。

05:23.448 --> 05:24.896
I JUST THREW UP A LITTLE
IN MY MOUTH.
我刚刚吐了一点
在我嘴里。

05:24.965 --> 05:26.758
NO NEED TO WORRY, SQUIDDY.
不用担心，鱿鱼。

05:26.827 --> 05:28.275
YOU'VE OUTDONE YOURSELF.
你已经超越了自己。

05:28.344 --> 05:31.310
HE'LL BE CRYING IN TEN MINUTES.
十分钟后他就会哭了。

05:31.379 --> 05:32.310
HA!
哈！

05:32.379 --> 05:36.000
[laughs]
[笑]

05:39.241 --> 05:41.241
HA.
哈。

05:41.310 --> 05:43.241
- THANKS AGAIN FOR WALKING HOME
WITH ME, SQUIDWARD.
- 再次感谢您步行回家
跟我一起，章鱼哥。

05:43.310 --> 05:45.517
- THERE'S A FIRST TIME
FOR EVERYTHING.
- 这是第一次
对于一切。

05:45.586 --> 05:48.551
ALSO I'D LIKE TO WIN THIS BET
AS SOON AS POSSIBLE.
我也想赢这个赌注
尽快。

05:48.620 --> 05:50.655
[snickers maniacally]
[疯狂地窃笑]

05:50.724 --> 05:51.793
- I'M NOT GONNA CRY.
- 我不会哭。

05:51.862 --> 05:52.862
I'M NOT GONNA CRY.
我不会哭。

05:52.931 --> 05:55.103
I CAN DO THIS.
我能做到。

05:55.172 --> 05:57.241
- DO WHAT?
- 做什么？

05:57.310 --> 05:58.965
OH, MY.
哦，我的。

05:59.034 --> 06:00.689
WHAT A LOVELY SUNSET.
多么美丽的日落啊。

06:00.758 --> 06:02.965
TAKE A LOOK, SPONGEBOB.
看一看，海绵宝宝。

06:03.034 --> 06:04.379
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:04.448 --> 06:06.758
- ISN'T THAT BEAUTIFUL?
- 那不是很漂亮吗？

06:06.827 --> 06:09.620
- I'VE NEVER SEEN SUCH
A BEAUTIFUL UNDERWATER SUNSET.
- 我从来没有见过这样的
美丽的水下日落。

06:09.689 --> 06:12.034
- REALLY TUGS AT
THE HEARTSTRINGS, DOESN'T IT?
- 真的很拉扯
心弦，不是吗？

06:12.103 --> 06:13.068
- MM-HMM.
- 嗯嗯。

06:13.137 --> 06:14.137
IT...
它...

06:14.206 --> 06:18.103
[angelic singing]
[天使般的歌声]

06:18.172 --> 06:19.862
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

06:22.034 --> 06:24.000
IS THAT A TEAR I SEE?
我看到的是一滴眼泪吗？

06:27.034 --> 06:29.241
- OH, WELL, SUNSET'S OVER.
- 哦，好吧，日落结束了。

06:29.310 --> 06:30.068
- UGH.
- 呃。

06:32.827 --> 06:34.344
- NICE OF YOU TO DROP IN,
NEIGHBOR.
- 很高兴您能来参加，
邻居。

06:34.413 --> 06:36.206
- NICE OF YOU TO HAVE ME.
I--
- 很高兴你有我。
我 -

06:36.275 --> 06:38.000
OH, LOOK, SPONGEBOB.
哦，看，海绵宝宝。

06:38.068 --> 06:40.310
GARY'S SLEEPING.
加里在睡觉。

06:40.379 --> 06:43.137
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

06:43.206 --> 06:46.275
- AW, HE LOOKS LIKE AN ANGEL.
- 哇，他看起来像天使。

06:46.344 --> 06:48.896
- THAT IS JUST SO ADORABLE.
- 这真是太可爱了。

06:48.965 --> 06:52.448
ALMOST MAKES YOU WANT TO CRY.
几乎让你想哭。

06:52.517 --> 06:53.482
- YEAH...
- 是的...

06:53.551 --> 06:55.413
NO.
不。

06:55.482 --> 06:56.689
THERE SHALL BE NO TEARS
IN THIS HOUSE TONIGHT.
不会有眼泪
今晚在这所房子里。

06:56.758 --> 07:00.310
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA-LA ♪
♪ 拉-拉-拉-拉-拉 ♪

07:00.379 --> 07:01.931
- OH, SPONGEBOB?
- 哦，海绵宝宝？

07:02.000 --> 07:03.448
- YES?
- YOUR MAIL'S HERE.
- 是的？
- 你的邮件在这里。

07:03.517 --> 07:05.413
OOH.
OH, LOOK.
哦。
哦，看。

07:05.482 --> 07:08.172
IT'S A POSTCARD FROM
YOUR DEAR MOTHER AND FATHER
这是一张来自
你亲爱的母亲和父亲

07:08.241 --> 07:09.620
SO FAR AWAY.
那么远。

07:09.689 --> 07:11.586
- MOTHER?
FATHER?
- 母亲？
父亲？

07:11.655 --> 07:14.000
- "DEAR SPONGEBOB,
WE ARE HAVING A WONDERFUL TIME
- “亲爱的海绵宝宝，
我们度过了一段美好的时光

07:14.068 --> 07:15.620
"IN THE SOUTH SEAS,
“在南海，

07:15.689 --> 07:18.275
AND WE MISS YOU
VERY, VERY MUCH."
我们想念你
非常非常。”

07:18.344 --> 07:20.344
- OH...
- 哦...

07:20.413 --> 07:22.137
MY SUBSCRIPTION TO JELLY FISHING
MONTHLY'SEXPIRED.
我对《果冻钓鱼》的订阅
每月已过期。

07:22.206 --> 07:23.689
REMIND ME TO RENEW THAT,
WILL YOU, SQUIDWARD?
提醒我更新，
你愿意吗，章鱼哥？

07:23.758 --> 07:27.137
- NO PROBLEM.
- 没问题。

07:27.206 --> 07:29.206
- WELCOME BACK
TO BIKINI BOTTOM NEWS.
- 欢迎回来
浏览比基尼下装新闻。

07:29.275 --> 07:30.827
OUR TOP STORY TONIGHT,
今晚我们的头条新闻，

07:30.896 --> 07:33.137
A SERIES OF SAD TALES.
一系列悲伤的故事。

07:33.206 --> 07:34.344
- OOH, LET'S TURN IT UP.
- 哦，让我们把它打开。

07:34.413 --> 07:35.965
- TRAGEDY IN THE PARK
- 公园里的悲剧

07:36.034 --> 07:37.655
WHEN A YOUNG SNAIL
CAUGHT IN A TREE
当一只小蜗牛
被困在树上

07:37.724 --> 07:39.413
ALMOST DIDN'T GET DOWN.
差点没下来。

07:39.482 --> 07:40.551
- MEOW.
- 喵。

07:40.620 --> 07:41.896
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:41.965 --> 07:42.827
- HOWEVER,
- 然而，

07:42.896 --> 07:44.172
HE DID...
他确实...

07:44.241 --> 07:45.241
GET DOWN.
下来。

07:45.310 --> 07:46.827
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

07:46.896 --> 07:48.137
- COMING UP,
- 即将到来，

07:48.206 --> 07:49.965
AN INTERVIEW WITH A MANATEE
海牛访谈

07:50.034 --> 07:52.034
WHO DIDN'T GET WHAT HE WANTED
FOR HIS BIRTHDAY.
谁没有得到他想要的
为了他的生日。

07:52.103 --> 07:53.586
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

07:53.655 --> 07:55.206
- AND FINALLY, SAD NEWS
- 最后是一个悲伤的消息

07:55.275 --> 07:57.758
FOR MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY FANS.
献给美人鱼男
还有藤壶男孩的粉丝。

07:57.827 --> 07:59.103
- WHAT? WHAT?
WHAT?
- 什么？什么？
什么？

07:59.172 --> 08:00.965
- THEY WILL ONLY BE SHOWING
- 他们只会展示

08:01.034 --> 08:02.551
THE MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY SHOW
美人鱼男人
和藤壶男孩秀

08:02.620 --> 08:05.068
SEVEN TIMES A DAY
INSTEAD OF EIGHT.
一天七次
而不是八个。

08:05.137 --> 08:06.862
- LET'S WATCH SOMETHING ELSE,
SQUIDWARD, OKAY?
- 让我们看点别的吧
章鱼哥，好吗？

08:06.931 --> 08:07.931
- FINE!
- 美好的！

08:10.275 --> 08:11.482
- HEY, DAD.
- 嘿，爸爸。

08:11.551 --> 08:13.448
HOW ABOUT A GAME OF CATCH?
接球游戏怎么样？

08:13.517 --> 08:14.586
- SORRY, SON.
- 对不起，儿子。

08:14.655 --> 08:16.206
I'M LATE FOR WORK.
我上班迟到了。

08:16.275 --> 08:19.172
- OKAY, DAD.
- 好吧，爸爸。

08:19.241 --> 08:22.344
- I GUESS I CAN STAY
FOR A FEW THROWS.
- 我想我可以留下来
扔几次。

08:22.413 --> 08:23.896
- I LOVE YOU, DAD.
- 我爱你，爸爸。

08:23.965 --> 08:26.448
- I LOVE YOU, SON.
- 我爱你，儿子。

08:28.000 --> 08:28.931
zap!
噗！

08:29.000 --> 08:30.034
- UGH!
- 呃！

08:30.103 --> 08:33.275
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:33.344 --> 08:35.068
YOU KNOW WHAT THEY SAY ABOUT
THAT TELEVISION--
你知道他们怎么说
那台电视——

08:35.137 --> 08:36.724
ROTS THE BRAIN.
腐蚀大脑。

08:36.793 --> 08:38.379
- HEY, THANKS FOR THE TV,
SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，谢谢你的电视，
海绵宝宝。

08:38.448 --> 08:40.344
I'M GONNA WATCH IT ALL NIGHT.
我会看整晚。

08:44.344 --> 08:46.689
[clock ticking]
[时钟滴答作响]

08:46.758 --> 08:48.379
- IT'S GETTING LATE.
- 已经晚了。

08:48.448 --> 08:50.310
I'D BETTER BRING OUT
THE BIG GUNS.
我最好带出来
大枪。

08:50.379 --> 08:51.862
OH, SPONGEBOB?
哦，海绵宝宝？

08:51.931 --> 08:53.103
- YES, SQUIDWARD?
- 是的，章鱼哥？

08:53.172 --> 08:54.206
- WHAT WOULD YOU SAY TO
- 你想说什么

08:54.275 --> 08:55.310
A LITTLE MUSIC?
一点音乐？

08:55.379 --> 08:56.379
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:56.448 --> 08:58.103
I'D SAY...
我想说...

08:58.172 --> 08:59.137
I'LL GO AND GET
SOME REFRESHMENTS.
我去拿
一些茶点。

08:59.206 --> 09:00.448
- DON'T BE LONG.
- 不要太长。

09:00.517 --> 09:02.103
MY SECRET WEAPON IS WAITING.
我的秘密武器正在等待着。

09:02.172 --> 09:03.724
[chuckles]
[笑声]

09:03.793 --> 09:05.517
- YOU SAID SOMETHING,
SQUIDWARD?
- 你说了些什么，
章鱼哥？

09:05.586 --> 09:08.241
- OH, I JUST SAID,
"RELAX, AND ENJOY THE SONG".
- 哦，我刚才说，
“放松，享受这首歌”。

09:08.310 --> 09:11.275
[melancholy melody]
[忧郁的旋律]

09:11.344 --> 09:12.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:12.517 --> 09:14.620
- [sniffles]
- [抽鼻子]

09:14.689 --> 09:18.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:18.827 --> 09:21.689
- [pants]
- [裤子]

09:21.758 --> 09:23.965
- THAT'S A REALLY SAD SONG,
SQUIDWARD.
- 这真是一首悲伤的歌，
章鱼哥。

09:24.034 --> 09:25.413
- YOU'RE NOT GONNA CRY THOUGH,
ARE YOU?
- 但你不会哭，
你是吗？

09:25.482 --> 09:27.275
- NO.
- [grumbles]
- 不。
- [抱怨]

09:27.344 --> 09:29.206
[cuckoos]
[杜鹃]

09:29.275 --> 09:31.137
- TIME REALLY DOES FLY
WHEN YOU'RE HAVING FUN.
- 时间过得真快
当你玩得开心的时候。

09:31.206 --> 09:32.965
WELL, I BETTER START
GETTING READY FOR BED.
好吧，我最好开始了
准备睡觉。

09:33.034 --> 09:34.275
- UH, SPONGEBOB,
NO, NO, NO.
- 呃，海绵宝宝，
不，不，不。

09:34.344 --> 09:35.379
UH, WAIT.
呃，等等。

09:35.448 --> 09:36.655
- YES, SQUIDWARD?
- 是的，章鱼哥？

09:36.724 --> 09:37.862
- HOW ABOUT A BEDTIME STORY?
- 睡前故事怎么样？

09:37.931 --> 09:40.620
- NOW YOU'RE TALKING.
- 现在你开始说话了。

09:40.689 --> 09:41.689
WHATCHA GONNA READ ME,
SQUIDWARD?
我要读什么，
章鱼哥？

09:41.758 --> 09:44.344
- UM...
- 嗯...

09:44.413 --> 09:47.137
HOW ABOUT THE LITTLE ANGLER
WHO GOT LOST?
小钓鱼者怎么样
谁迷路了？

09:47.206 --> 09:48.965
- THAT SOUNDS LIKE
A VERY SAD STORY.
- 听起来像
一个非常悲伤的故事。

09:49.034 --> 09:51.482
- OH, VERY SAD.
- 哦，非常难过。

09:51.551 --> 09:53.413
THERE ONCE WAS A LITTLE ANGLER
从前有一个小钓鱼者

09:53.482 --> 09:56.758
WHO WAS LITTLE AND SAD.
他又小又悲伤。

09:56.827 --> 09:58.206
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

09:58.275 --> 10:00.310
- ONE DAY THE LITTLE SAD ANGLER
- 有一天，悲伤的小钓鱼者

10:00.379 --> 10:02.482
WAS WALKING THROUGH THE PARK.
正在穿过公园。

10:02.551 --> 10:03.862
- [chuckles] WALKING.
- [轻笑]走路。

10:03.931 --> 10:05.931
- BUT HE WAS SAD.
- 但他很伤心。

10:06.000 --> 10:07.206
BECAUSE...
BECAUSE...
因为...
因为...

10:07.275 --> 10:08.862
HE WAS LOST.
他迷路了。

10:08.931 --> 10:11.758
HE WAS LOST AND VERY SAD.
他很失落，非常悲伤。

10:11.827 --> 10:14.827
AND THEN HE--
HE STARTED TO CRY.
然后他——
他开始哭泣。

10:14.896 --> 10:17.620
HE CRIED AND HE CRIED,
他哭了，他哭了，

10:17.689 --> 10:19.172
AND HE CRIED EVEN MORE.
他哭得更厉害了。

10:19.241 --> 10:21.758
AND HE KEPT CRYING AND CRYING
他一直哭啊哭

10:21.827 --> 10:25.000
AND CRYING AND CRYING AND...
哭啊哭啊……

10:25.068 --> 10:27.482
THAT'S RIGHT.
YOU CAN DO IT.
这是正确的。
你可以做到。

10:27.551 --> 10:29.965
- I'M WONDERING IF IT MIGHT NOT
BE SO HEALTHY
- 我想知道是否可能不会
保持健康

10:30.034 --> 10:32.206
TO HOLD IN ALL MY TEARS,
SQUIDWARD.
忍住我所有的泪水，
章鱼哥。

10:32.275 --> 10:33.413
- YOU'RE EXACTLY RIGHT,
SPONGEBOB.
- 你说得完全正确，
海绵宝宝。

10:33.482 --> 10:34.586
LET IT ALL OUT.
全部释放出来。

10:34.655 --> 10:36.620
DON'T FIGHT THE FEEL--
不要抗拒这种感觉——

10:36.689 --> 10:37.827
[ticking]
[滴答作响]

10:37.896 --> 10:39.689
TEN, NINE...
十、九……

10:39.758 --> 10:40.827
DO IT. DO IT.
CRY.
去做吧。去做吧。
哭。

10:40.896 --> 10:42.793
EIGHT, SEVEN, SIX,
八、七、六、

10:42.862 --> 10:43.793
FIVE...
五...

10:43.862 --> 10:45.000
COME ON!
快点！

10:45.068 --> 10:47.689
FOUR, THREE, TWO, ONE.
四、三、二、一。

10:47.758 --> 10:49.586
[cuckoos]
[杜鹃]

10:49.655 --> 10:52.000
MIDNIGHT.
午夜。

10:52.068 --> 10:53.655
[sighs]
[叹气]

10:53.724 --> 10:55.586
WELL, SPONGEBOB,
嗯，海绵宝宝，

10:55.655 --> 10:57.655
IT LOOKS LIKE YOU WON THE--
看来您赢得了——

10:57.724 --> 11:00.206
- [sobs violently]
- [剧烈抽泣]

11:07.137 --> 11:08.206
- WOW.
- 哇。

11:08.275 --> 11:11.551
WHAT A GREAT SHOW.
真是一场精彩的表演。

11:11.620 --> 11:15.586
- WELL, AT LEAST WE'RE STILL
TOGETHER, LITTLE ONES.
- 好吧，至少我们还在
小家伙们，在一起吧。

11:15.655 --> 11:17.896
[angelic singing]
[天使般的歌声]

11:22.206 --> 11:24.655
thud!
砰！

11:24.724 --> 11:26.206
- MORE POPCORN, SQUIDWARD?
- 再来点爆米花吧，章鱼哥？

11:26.275 --> 11:27.275
- NO, NO.
- 不，不。

11:27.344 --> 11:28.758
NO, NO, PLEASE.
不，不，拜托。

11:28.827 --> 11:29.896
- DON'T BE SHY NOW.
- 现在别害羞。

11:29.965 --> 11:31.379
I MADE EXTRA.
我做了额外的。

11:31.448 --> 11:34.724
- [sniffles]
- [抽鼻子]

11:34.793 --> 11:36.137
- THAT'S ALL RIGHT.
LET IT OUT.
- 没关系。
让它出去。

11:36.206 --> 11:38.068
YOU CAN CRY ALL YOU WANT.
你想哭就哭吧。

11:38.137 --> 11:40.517
YOU'RE AMONG FRIENDS HERE.
你们是这里的朋友。

11:40.586 --> 11:43.379
- [cries]
- [哭声]

11:53.275 --> 11:56.275
[lively accordion music]
[活泼的手风琴音乐]

11:56.344 --> 12:02.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:02.758 --> 12:04.344
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

12:04.413 --> 12:07.000
[cheering]
[欢呼]

12:07.068 --> 12:09.034
- HAVE A GOOD SUMMER VACATION,
CLASS.
- 度过一个愉快的暑假，
阶级。

12:09.103 --> 12:12.241
I'LL SEE YOU ALL NEXT FALL.
明年秋天再见。

12:12.310 --> 12:16.689
WELL, HOPEFULLY NOT ALL OF YOU.
好吧，希望不是你们所有人。

12:16.758 --> 12:17.862
TIME TO VAMOOSE.
是时候进行浮肿了。

12:17.931 --> 12:20.931
- OH, MRS. PUFF?
- 哦，夫人。噗？

12:21.000 --> 12:22.344
- WHERE ARE MY KEYS?
- 我的钥匙在哪里？

12:22.413 --> 12:23.379
- MRS. PUFF?
- 太太。噗？

12:23.448 --> 12:24.724
- COME ON.
- 快点。

12:24.793 --> 12:27.551
- I'VE GOT SOMETHING FOR YOU.
- 我有东西给你。

12:27.620 --> 12:28.620
- AH-HAH!
- 啊哈！

12:28.689 --> 12:29.965
- MRS. PUFF?
- 太太。噗？

12:30.034 --> 12:31.241
- GET AWAY FROM ME.
- 离我远点。

12:31.310 --> 12:32.034
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

12:35.310 --> 12:36.275
[engine grinding]
[发动机磨削]

12:36.344 --> 12:38.310
- OH, MRS. PUFF?
- 哦，夫人。噗？

12:40.689 --> 12:41.931
- I GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE.
- 我得离开这里。

12:42.000 --> 12:43.586
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

12:45.689 --> 12:47.413
[engine turns over]
[发动机转动]

12:47.482 --> 12:48.517
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

12:52.310 --> 12:53.275
- PHEW.
- 唷。

12:53.344 --> 12:54.379
I LOST HIM.
我失去了他。

12:54.448 --> 12:55.344
- MRS. PUFF?
- 太太。噗？

12:55.413 --> 12:56.689
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

12:56.758 --> 12:58.586
- CAN I GIVE YOU MY NOTE NOW?
- 我现在可以给你我的笔记吗？

12:58.655 --> 13:00.068
- WHY CAN'T YOU TAKE A HINT?
- 为什么你不能接受提示？

13:00.137 --> 13:01.724
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:03.551 --> 13:05.137
- HELP.
- 帮助。

13:05.206 --> 13:08.068
- OH, DEAR.
OF COURSE I'LL HELP.
- 哦亲爱的。
我当然会帮忙。

13:08.137 --> 13:09.275
[engine revs]
[发动机转速]

13:15.379 --> 13:17.517
smack!
咂！

13:17.586 --> 13:20.586
- MRS. PUFF, DON'T FORGET TO
READ THE NOTE!
- 太太。噗，别忘了
阅读注意事项！

13:20.655 --> 13:22.758
- WHY WON'T HE JUST LE--
- 他为什么不直接离开--

13:22.827 --> 13:24.827
[screams]
[尖叫声]

13:24.896 --> 13:27.137
WHOA!
哇啊！

13:27.206 --> 13:28.137
crash!
碰撞！

13:32.758 --> 13:34.103
AH!
啊！

13:34.172 --> 13:36.172
OH, NO.
NOT AGAIN.
哦，不。
不会再有。

13:36.241 --> 13:39.172
IF MY PAROLE OFFICER FINDS OUT,
I DON'T STAND A CHANCE.
如果我的假释官发现了
我没有机会。

13:39.241 --> 13:41.896
I'LL BE SENTENCED FOR LIFE
THIS TIME.
我将被判终身监禁
这次。

13:41.965 --> 13:45.103
- HMM, QUITE A CONUNDRUM
YOU HAVE HERE.
- 嗯，真是个难题
你在这里。

13:45.172 --> 13:48.137
IT WOULD BE A CRYING SHAME
TO A CERTAIN SOMEONE
这将是一个令人哭泣的耻辱
对某个人

13:48.206 --> 13:51.000
IF THIS INFORMATION WERE TO LEAK
OUT TO THE AUTHORITIES.
如果此信息泄露
向当局举报。

13:51.068 --> 13:53.310
- OH, PLEASE,
DON'T TELL THE POLICE.
- 哦，拜托，
不要告诉警察。

13:53.379 --> 13:55.620
I'LL BE A DEAD MAN
IF I GET CAUGHT.
我会成为一个死人
如果我被抓住了。

13:55.689 --> 13:57.034
I'LL DO ANYTHING.
我会做任何事。

13:57.103 --> 13:58.620
- IT'S GONNA COST A FORTUNE
- 这将花费一大笔钱

13:58.689 --> 14:00.137
TO GET THIS FIXED...
要解决这个问题...

14:00.206 --> 14:01.620
THANKS TO YOU.
谢谢你。

14:01.689 --> 14:03.655
- OH, GRACIOUS ME.
- 噢，天哪。

14:03.724 --> 14:05.758
I DON'T HAVE THAT KIND OF CASH.
我没有那么多现金。

14:05.827 --> 14:07.413
- DON'T WORRY.
- 不用担心。

14:07.482 --> 14:08.448
I THINK WE CAN WORK
SOMETHING OUT.
我想我们可以合作
有东西出来了。

14:08.517 --> 14:10.103
- HUH?
- 嗯？

14:10.172 --> 14:12.310
YOU MEAN WE SHOULD GO OUT
ON A DATE?
你的意思是我们应该出去
约会？

14:12.379 --> 14:13.379
- UH...
- 呃...

14:13.448 --> 14:14.862
INTERESTING.
有趣的。

14:14.931 --> 14:16.379
NO, I HAD SOMETHING ELSE
IN MIND.
不，我还有别的事
铭记于心。

14:16.448 --> 14:18.000
SURPRISE, SPONGEBOB.
惊喜，海绵宝宝。

14:18.068 --> 14:19.620
YOU HAVE A NEW COWORKER.
您有一位新同事。

14:19.689 --> 14:21.172
- MRS. PUFF!
- 太太。噗！

14:21.241 --> 14:22.862
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

14:22.931 --> 14:23.896
- SHE'LL BE FILLING IN
FOR SQUIDWARD
- 她会填补空缺
为了章鱼哥

14:23.965 --> 14:24.827
WHILE HE'S...
虽然他...

14:24.896 --> 14:25.862
UH...
呃……

14:25.931 --> 14:27.172
ON VACATION.
正在度假。

14:27.241 --> 14:28.896
ISN'T THAT RIGHT, MRS. PUFF?
不对吗，夫人。噗？

14:28.965 --> 14:30.310
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

14:30.379 --> 14:32.586
- AND SHE'LL BE WORKING UNPAID
- 她将无薪工作

14:32.655 --> 14:35.793
UNTIL HE RETURNS,
WON'T SHE?
直到他回来，
她不会吗？

14:35.862 --> 14:38.068
- YEAH.
- 是的。

14:38.137 --> 14:39.275
- SQUIDWARD.
- 章鱼哥。

14:39.344 --> 14:40.620
I FORGOT TO TELL YOU,
我忘了告诉你，

14:40.689 --> 14:41.620
YOU'RE TAKING THE SUMMER OFF.
你要放暑假了。

14:41.689 --> 14:42.551
HAVE A GOOD TIME.
玩的很开心。

14:42.620 --> 14:43.758
SEE YA.
再见。

14:43.827 --> 14:45.310
WHOO, THAT WAS CLOSE.
哇，那已经很接近了。

14:45.379 --> 14:48.724
- IT ALL SOUNDS A BIT MYSTERIOUS
TO ME.
- 这一切听起来有点神秘
对我来说。

14:48.793 --> 14:50.379
BUT WHY SHOULD I CARE?
但我为什么要关心？

14:50.448 --> 14:52.724
I'M WORKING WITH
GOOD OLD MRS. PUFF.
我正在与
好老太太。噗。

14:52.793 --> 14:54.896
SAY, DID YOU GET MY NOTE?
说，你收到我的纸条了吗？

14:54.965 --> 14:57.275
- OH, I GOT YOUR NOTE ALL RIGHT.
- 哦，我没记错你的笔记。

14:57.344 --> 14:58.931
- SO WHAT DO YOU THINK?
- 那你觉得怎么样？

14:59.000 --> 15:00.241
- WHAT DID I THINK?
- 我怎么想的？

15:00.310 --> 15:02.379
I THINK IT CAUSED ME TO...
我想这让我...

15:02.448 --> 15:06.724
UH, LET'S JUST SAY
IT CHANGED MY LIFE.
呃，我们就这么说吧
它改变了我的生活。

15:06.793 --> 15:08.724
- IT CERTAINLY HAS.
- 确实如此。

15:08.793 --> 15:11.551
NOW SPONGEBOB, WOULD YOU PLEASE
SHOW MRS. PUFF HER NEW DUTIES
现在海绵宝宝，可以吗？
显示夫人。承担新的职责

15:11.620 --> 15:14.000
VIS-A-VIS
HER RECENTLY CHANGED LIFE,
可见光
她最近改变的生活，

15:14.068 --> 15:15.586
BECAUSE I SURE AS SNAIL SNOT
因为我确实像蜗牛鼻涕一样

15:15.655 --> 15:16.758
CAN'T BE BOTHERED TO DO IT.
懒得去做。

15:16.827 --> 15:18.379
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

15:18.448 --> 15:21.517
I GET TO SHOW YOU THE ROPES,
MRS. PUFF.
我要向你展示绳索，
夫人。噗。

15:21.586 --> 15:24.448
HEY, IT'S KINDA LIKE
I'M THE TEACHER.
嘿，有点像
我是老师。

15:24.517 --> 15:27.310
[laughs]
[笑]

15:27.379 --> 15:29.862
I'M GONNA BE TEACHING YOU NOW.
我现在要教你。

15:29.931 --> 15:32.241
- PATIENCE IS A VIRTUE.
- 耐心是一种美德。

15:32.310 --> 15:34.000
- SHALL WE START
WITH THE IMPORTANCE
- 我们可以开始吗
重要性

15:34.068 --> 15:36.000
OF GOOD KITCHEN HYGIENE?
良好的厨房卫生？

15:36.068 --> 15:37.965
OR THE UNABRIDGED HISTORY
OF THE PATTY?
或者未删节的历史
肉饼的？

15:38.034 --> 15:42.000
- WHY DON'T WE JUST START
WITH MY BASIC DUTIES?
- 我们为什么不开始
我的基本职责？

15:42.068 --> 15:44.034
- EAGER TO GET BEHIND THE WHEEL,
EH?
- 渴望掌舵，
呃？

15:44.103 --> 15:45.724
I LIKE IT.
我喜欢它。

15:45.793 --> 15:47.103
REPEAT AFTER ME:
跟着我重复：

15:47.172 --> 15:49.000
"THIS IS MY REGISTER.
“这是我的登记册。

15:49.068 --> 15:50.827
THERE ARE MANY LIKE IT,
BUT THIS ONE IS MINE."
有很多类似的，
但这是我的。”

15:50.896 --> 15:53.206
- THERE ARE MANY LIKE IT,
BUT THIS ONE IS MINE.
- 有很多喜欢的，
但这是我的。

15:53.275 --> 15:55.034
- NOW, LIKE A SHIP'S RUDDER,
- 现在，就像船舵一样，

15:55.103 --> 15:56.965
THIS OLD REGISTER
IS TEMPERAMENTAL.
这个旧寄存器
脾气暴躁。

15:57.034 --> 15:59.517
SO WHEN YOU HIT THE TOTAL KEY--
所以当你按下总键时——

15:59.586 --> 16:00.586
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
你在干什么？

16:00.655 --> 16:01.896
- NOTHING.
- 没有什么。

16:01.965 --> 16:03.275
- YOU'RE NOT TAKING NOTES?
- 你不做笔记吗？

16:03.344 --> 16:06.034
ALWAYS REMEMBER, GOOD GRADES...
永远记住，好成绩...

16:06.103 --> 16:08.517
both:
ONLY FOLLOW DILIGENT NOTES.
两者：
只遵循勤奋的笔记。

16:08.586 --> 16:09.758
- I KNOW, SPONGEBOB.
- 我知道，海绵宝宝。

16:09.827 --> 16:11.344
I TAUGHT YOU THAT PHRASE.
我教过你这句话。

16:11.413 --> 16:12.965
- DON'T WORRY, MRS. PUFF.
- 别担心，夫人。噗。

16:13.034 --> 16:15.724
YOU MAY BORROW MY NOTEPAD TODAY.
您今天可以借用我的记事本。

16:15.793 --> 16:16.827
NOW, WHERE WAS I?
现在，我在哪里？

16:16.896 --> 16:18.172
OH, YES.
哦是的。

16:18.241 --> 16:19.862
THE TOTAL KEY IS A BIT STICKY,
总钥匙有点粘，

16:19.931 --> 16:21.103
SO YOU'RE GOING TO HAVE TO BE
FORCEFUL,
所以你必须这样做
有力，

16:21.172 --> 16:23.206
BUT NOT TOO FORCEFUL.
但不要太用力。

16:23.275 --> 16:24.862
DID YOU GET THAT?
你明白了吗？

16:24.931 --> 16:26.172
- FORCEFUL,
BUT NOT TOO FORCEFUL.
- 有力，
但不要太用力。

16:26.241 --> 16:27.793
- YOU DID!
- 你做到了！

16:27.862 --> 16:31.862
DILIGENCE LIKE THIS
DESERVES A STICKER.
像这样的勤奋
值得一张贴纸。

16:31.931 --> 16:35.206
COLLECT TEN, AND YOU'RE ENTITLED
TO A "SUPER" STICKER.
收集十个，你就有资格
到“超级”贴纸。

16:35.275 --> 16:37.034
WHY DON'T WE WORK
ON OUR CUSTOMER SERVICE
我们为什么不工作
关于我们的客户服务

16:37.103 --> 16:38.896
WITH A LITTLE ROLE PLAYING?
玩一点角色扮演？

16:38.965 --> 16:40.965
I'LL BE THE CUSTOMER,
AND YOU SHOW ME YOUR BEST
我将成为客户，
你向我展示了你最好的一面

16:41.034 --> 16:42.620
AND FRIENDLIEST SERVICE, HMM?
最友好的服务，嗯？

16:42.689 --> 16:45.379
- FINE.
- 美好的。

16:45.448 --> 16:46.689
- [in British accent]
GOOD DAY, M'LADY.
- [英国口音]
美好的一天，女士。

16:46.758 --> 16:48.379
CHARMED, I'M SURE.
我确定，很着迷。

16:48.448 --> 16:50.551
- FUNNY COSTUME, SPONGEBOB.
- 有趣的服装，海绵宝宝。

16:50.620 --> 16:53.275
- FORGIVE ME, BUT I KNOW NOT OF
THIS SPONGEBOB FELLOW.
- 请原谅我，但我不知道
这个海绵宝宝。

16:53.344 --> 16:55.344
MY NAME IS
DUKE THOMAS FEATHERMUFFIN,
我的名字是
托马斯公爵羽毛松饼，

16:55.413 --> 16:57.137
AND I ENTERED YOUR PLACE
OF BUSINESS
我进入了你的位置
业务范围

16:57.206 --> 16:59.068
IN HOPES OF PROCURING LUNCH
ON THIS FINE DAY.
希望能买到午餐
在这个美好的日子。

16:59.137 --> 17:02.068
- OF COURSE, MR. FEATHERMUFFIN.
- 当然，先生。羽毛松饼。

17:02.137 --> 17:03.931
WHAT WOULD YOU LIKE TO EAT
TODAY?
你想吃什么
今天？

17:04.000 --> 17:05.344
- psst!
MRS. PUFF.
- 嘘！
太太。噗。

17:05.413 --> 17:07.379
IT'S ME, SPONGEBOB.
是我，海绵宝宝。

17:07.448 --> 17:10.310
I THINK THIS WILL GO SMOOTHER IF
YOU JUST REFER TO HIM AS DUKE.
我认为这会变得更顺利，如果
您只需称他为公爵即可。

17:10.379 --> 17:12.137
- [sighs] YOU MEAN TO REFER
TO YOU AS DUKE.
- [叹气]你的意思是参考
作为公爵的你。

17:12.206 --> 17:13.517
- OF COURSE.
- 当然。

17:13.586 --> 17:14.724
HOW ELSE WOULD ONE REFER TO ME?
不然怎么会提到我呢？

17:14.793 --> 17:16.931
I AM A DUKE, AFTER ALL.
毕竟我是公爵。

17:17.000 --> 17:18.896
NOW, I SHOULD FANCY A MEAL, IF
IT'S QUITE ALL RIGHT WITH YOU.
现在，我应该想吃一顿饭，如果
你没问题。

17:18.965 --> 17:20.034
- OKAY, DUKE.
- 好吧，杜克。

17:20.103 --> 17:21.655
WHAT'LL YOU HAVE?
你会得到什么？

17:21.724 --> 17:24.172
- I SHALL HAVE BEANS ON TOAST,
PLEASE.
- 我要在吐司上加豆子，
请。

17:24.241 --> 17:27.448
- ALL RIGHT, ONE BEANS ON TOAST
COMING UP.
- 好吧，吐司上放一粒豆子
即将到来。

17:27.517 --> 17:29.655
- psst! MRS. PUFF,
SPONGEBOB AGAIN.
- 嘘！太太。噗噗，
海绵宝宝又来了。

17:29.724 --> 17:32.103
YOU BETTER INFORM THE DUKE THAT
WE DON'T SERVE BEANS ON TOAST.
你最好告诉公爵
我们不将豆子放在吐司上。

17:32.172 --> 17:33.275
- UGH.
- 呃。

17:33.344 --> 17:35.068
THIS IS JUST RIDICULOUS.
这太荒谬了。

17:35.137 --> 17:38.000
WOULD YOU SIMPLY EXPLAIN
MY DUTIES, PLEASE?
您能简单解释一下吗
请问我的职责是什么？

17:38.068 --> 17:40.896
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING
YELLING AT ME CUSTOMERS?
- 你在做什么
对我的顾客大喊大叫？

17:40.965 --> 17:43.379
THE DUKE HERE
IS ONE OF ME REGULARS.
公爵在这里
是我的常客之一。

17:43.448 --> 17:46.517
AND I DON'T NEED TO EXPLAIN
WHAT HAPPENS
我不需要解释
发生了什么

17:46.586 --> 17:49.655
WHEN YOU START LOSING
YOUR REGULARITY, DO I?
当你开始亏损时
你的规律性，是吗？

17:49.724 --> 17:51.586
- OH, DEAR.
- 哦亲爱的。

17:51.655 --> 17:53.931
MESSAGE RECEIVED, MR. KRABS.
消息已收到，先生。螃蟹。

17:54.000 --> 17:57.551
- JUST DON'T LET IT HAPPEN
AGAIN, PUFF.
- 不要让它发生
再次，噗。

17:57.620 --> 18:00.275
- WELL, I SEE YOU HAD A LITTLE
TROUBLE GETTING IN GEAR THERE,
- 好吧，我看你喝了一点
难以适应那里，

18:00.344 --> 18:02.551
BUT YOU'LL BE IN THE FAST LANE
BEFORE YOU KNOW IT.
但你会进入快车道
在您知道之前。

18:02.620 --> 18:03.896
[door opens]
[门打开]

18:03.965 --> 18:05.827
AH, HERE COMES ANOTHER CUSTOMER.
啊，又来了一位顾客。

18:05.896 --> 18:09.413
LET'S SEE IF YOU CAN APPLY
WHAT YOU'VE LEARNED.
让我们看看您是否可以申请
你学到了什么。

18:09.482 --> 18:11.172
- WELCOME TO THE KRUSTY KRAB,
SIR.
- 欢迎来到蟹堡王，
先生。

18:11.241 --> 18:13.000
MAY I TAKE YOUR ORDER?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

18:13.068 --> 18:14.310
- YES!
- 是的！

18:14.379 --> 18:16.137
- ONE KRABBY PATTY, PLEASE.
- 请来一份蟹肉饼。

18:16.206 --> 18:17.724
- $1, PLEASE.
- 1 美元，请。

18:17.793 --> 18:18.931
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

18:19.000 --> 18:21.000
- GOOD JOB, MRS. PUFF.
- 干得好，夫人。噗。

18:21.068 --> 18:24.241
NOW, ALL THAT'S LEFT IS TO
SUBMIT THE ORDER TO THE COOK.
现在，剩下的就是
将订单提交给厨师。

18:24.310 --> 18:26.241
- ONE KRABBY PATTY.
- 一份蟹肉饼。

18:26.310 --> 18:28.241
- OH, MRS. PUFF.
- 哦，夫人。噗。

18:28.310 --> 18:29.551
- WHAT?
- 什么？

18:29.620 --> 18:31.448
- IT MUST HAVE SLIPPED YOUR MIND
- 你一定忘记了

18:31.517 --> 18:33.241
THAT YOU NEED TO SUBMIT
THE ORDER IN WRITING AS WELL.
您需要提交的内容
书面顺序也是如此。

18:33.310 --> 18:35.275
IT'S THE ONLY WAY TO ENSURE
MAXIMUM CLARITY.
这是确保的唯一方法
最大清晰度。

18:35.344 --> 18:36.517
- FINE.
- 美好的。

18:36.586 --> 18:38.517
HERE'S YOUR WRITTEN FORM.
这是您的书面表格。

18:38.586 --> 18:40.965
- ONE KRABBY PATTY.
- 一份蟹肉饼。

18:41.034 --> 18:42.000
MRS. PUFF?
太太。噗？

18:42.068 --> 18:43.862
- WHAT NOW?
- 现在怎么办？

18:43.931 --> 18:45.931
- I CAN'T BEGIN COOKING
UNTIL THE BELL HAS RUNG.
- 我无法开始做饭
直到铃声响起。

18:46.000 --> 18:46.931
smack!
咂！

18:47.000 --> 18:48.896
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

18:48.965 --> 18:50.724
ALTHOUGH A SMIDGE LESS RIGOROUS
NEXT TIME, PLEASE.
虽然稍微不那么严格
请下次。

18:50.793 --> 18:54.000
- [mumbles angrily]
- [愤怒地咕哝]

18:54.068 --> 18:55.517
- ORDER UP!
- 订购！

18:55.586 --> 18:57.206
YOU'VE DONE WELL SO FAR,
STUDENT.
到目前为止你做得很好，
学生。

18:57.275 --> 18:59.482
NOW, WE DELIVER THE ITEM
TO THE CUSTOMER.
现在，我们交付物品
致客户。

18:59.551 --> 19:02.172
BE CAUTIOUS, BUT SWIFT.
小心谨慎，但要迅速。

19:02.241 --> 19:03.931
I WOULDN'T GO THAT WAY
IF I WERE YOU.
我不会那样做
如果我是你。

19:04.000 --> 19:05.241
IT'S FASTER IF YOU GO THIS WAY,
MRS. P.
如果你走这条路会更快
夫人。 P。

19:08.068 --> 19:09.241
LOOK OUT FOR THE BARREL.
留意枪管。

19:09.310 --> 19:10.137
- I'LL GIVE YOU A BAR--
- 我给你一个酒吧--

19:10.206 --> 19:12.000
WHOA!
哇啊！

19:12.068 --> 19:14.724
- WATCH FOR PEDESTRIANS.
- 注意行人。

19:14.793 --> 19:15.758
- AH!
- 啊！

19:15.827 --> 19:17.241
thud!
砰！

19:19.551 --> 19:21.275
- POTHOLE!
- 坑洞！

19:21.344 --> 19:23.241
- HEY!
- 嘿！

19:23.310 --> 19:26.793
- LOOK OUT, MRS. PUFF.
- 小心，夫人。噗。

19:26.862 --> 19:29.379
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

19:29.448 --> 19:31.310
- TIME FOR EVASIVE ACTION.
- 采取回避行动的时间到了。

19:31.379 --> 19:33.448
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

19:36.103 --> 19:37.379
[screams]
[尖叫声]

19:37.448 --> 19:39.551
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

19:43.448 --> 19:44.655
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

19:46.413 --> 19:47.413
ding!
叮！

19:50.827 --> 19:53.551
- AND THE PATTY IS UNSCATHED.
- 肉饼毫发无伤。

19:53.620 --> 19:55.034
WAY TO GO, MRS. PUFF.
一路走好，夫人。噗。

19:55.103 --> 19:57.241
YOUR FIRST SATISFIED CUSTOMER.
您的第一个满意的客户。

19:57.310 --> 19:59.655
I WILL HAVE TO DEDUCT POINTS
FOR THAT LANDING, THOUGH.
我将不得不扣分
不过，为了这次着陆。

19:59.724 --> 20:01.413
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

20:01.482 --> 20:03.275
THAT'S IT.
I DON'T CARE ANYMORE.
就是这样。
我不在乎了。

20:03.344 --> 20:05.482
THIS ISN'T WORTH IT.
这不值得。

20:08.034 --> 20:09.241
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

20:13.482 --> 20:17.034
I WILL NOT BE HUMILIATED
ANY LONGER.
我不会被羞辱
再长一点。

20:21.034 --> 20:24.551
- DON'T FORGET TO READ THE NOTE.
- 不要忘记阅读说明。

20:24.620 --> 20:27.241
- YOU!
- 你！

20:27.310 --> 20:30.655
IT'S BECAUSE OF YOU
I GOT STUCK IN THIS MESS.
因为你
我陷入了困境。

20:32.482 --> 20:34.482
UGH!
啊！

20:34.551 --> 20:36.241
- HOLD IT RIGHT THERE.
- 按住它。

20:36.310 --> 20:37.586
WELL, WELL, WELL.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

20:37.655 --> 20:39.965
IF IT AIN'T MRS. PUFF.
如果不是夫人噗。

20:40.034 --> 20:42.482
I SAW WHAT YOU DID.
我看到你做了什么。

20:42.551 --> 20:44.793
- [gulps]
UH, YOU DID?
- [吞咽]
呃，你做到了？

20:44.862 --> 20:45.862
- YEAH.
- 是的。

20:45.931 --> 20:47.310
- OH, PLEASE.
- 哦，拜托。

20:47.379 --> 20:49.034
I DIDN'T MEAN TO DO IT.
I SWEAR.
我不是故意的。
我发誓。

20:49.103 --> 20:50.344
- IT'S TOO LATE FOR SWEARING,
PUFF.
- 现在说脏话已经太晚了，
噗。

20:50.413 --> 20:52.275
THE EVIDENCE IS RIGHT HERE.
证据就在这里。

20:52.344 --> 20:54.103
YOU LITTERED.
你乱扔垃圾。

20:54.172 --> 20:56.620
AND NOW YOU'RE GOING
TO THE STONY LONESOME.
现在你要走了
致冷漠的孤独者。

20:56.689 --> 20:58.137
- LITTERED?
- 乱扔垃圾？

20:58.206 --> 21:00.068
[gasps]
[喘气]

21:00.137 --> 21:02.931
YOU'RE ABSOLUTELY RIGHT,
OFFICER.
你是绝对正确的，
军官。

21:03.000 --> 21:05.965
YES, I SURE DID LITTER.
是的，我确实乱扔垃圾。

21:06.034 --> 21:07.655
THAT'S WHAT I DID.
我就是这么做的。

21:07.724 --> 21:08.827
- YEAH.
ALL RIGHT.
- 是的。
好的。

21:08.896 --> 21:11.344
YOU'RE UNDER ARREST NOW.
你现在被捕了。

21:11.413 --> 21:13.413
- NO PROBLEM, OFFICER.
- 没问题，警官。

21:13.482 --> 21:16.931
TIME BY MYSELF IN THE STONY
LONESOME IS JUST WHAT I NEED.
独自在石头里的时光
孤独正是我所需要的。

21:17.000 --> 21:19.482
- TELL IT TO THE JUDGE,
MRS. PUFF.
- 告诉法官，
夫人。噗。

21:19.551 --> 21:23.000
- [laughing hysterically]
- [歇斯底里地大笑]

21:31.689 --> 21:32.862
ONE DAY DOWN.
一天下来。

21:32.931 --> 21:36.034
2,528 TO GO.
2,528 人出发。

21:36.103 --> 21:40.206
THAT'S JUST SHY OF FOUR YEARS
WITHOUT SPONGEBOB.
还不到四年
没有海绵宝宝。

21:40.275 --> 21:44.206
I'M GOING TO ENJOY THIS.
我会享受这个。

21:44.275 --> 21:46.000
- GET UP, PUFF.
- 站起来，噗。

21:46.068 --> 21:48.241
THE JUDGE SAYS YOU HAVE TO GO
TO TRAFFIC SCHOOL.
法官说你必须离开
去交通学校。

21:51.413 --> 21:52.655
- OH, WOW.
- 哦，哇。

21:52.724 --> 21:55.068
A DRIVER'S EDUCATION CLASS.
驾驶员教育课程。

21:55.137 --> 21:58.724
IT'S JUST HOW I MADE A LIVING,
EXCEPT WITHOUT...
这就是我谋生的方式
除非没有……

21:58.793 --> 22:00.517
HIM.
他。

22:00.586 --> 22:02.137
OH, DELIGHTFUL.
哦，令人愉快。

22:02.206 --> 22:04.931
- GOOD DAY, CLASS.
- 同学们，大家好。

22:05.000 --> 22:06.620
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

22:06.689 --> 22:07.965
smack!
咂！

22:08.034 --> 22:09.862
I MUST BE HAVING A NIGHTMARE.
我一定是在做噩梦。

22:09.931 --> 22:11.620
WHAT'S HE DOING HERE?
他在这里做什么？

22:11.689 --> 22:13.344
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

22:13.413 --> 22:15.344
- DIDN'T YOU READ THE NOTE,
MRS. PUFF?
- 你没读过纸条吗？
夫人。噗？

22:15.413 --> 22:17.241
HERE, I TAPED IT TOGETHER
AND SAVED IT JUST IN CASE.
在这里，我把它录在一起
并保存起来以防万一。

22:17.310 --> 22:18.689
"DEAR MRS. PUFF.
“亲爱的普芙夫人。

22:18.758 --> 22:20.931
"I'M FOLLOWING IN YOUR FOOTSTEPS
“我正在追随你的脚步

22:21.000 --> 22:24.206
"AND GOT A JOB AS A DRIVER'S ED
TEACHER FOR THE SUMMER.
“并找到了一份司机教育的工作
暑期老师。

22:24.275 --> 22:26.034
HEART, SPONGEBOB."
心，海绵宝宝。”

22:26.103 --> 22:28.172
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

22:28.241 --> 22:30.275
GET ME OUTTA HERE!
带我离开这里！

22:30.344 --> 22:31.586
[cries]
[哭声]

22:31.655 --> 22:33.724
UH! OW!
OH!
呃！噢！
哦！

22:33.793 --> 22:37.137
YOW! YOW!
AH!
哟！哟！
啊！

22:37.206 --> 22:40.724
- NOW, LET'S OPEN OUR DRIVER'S
ED HANDBOOKS TO CHAPTER ONE.
- 现在，让我们打开我们的司机
第一章的 ED 手册。

22:40.793 --> 22:43.689
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

